  "body": "### Summary\n\nProposed by Bybifok (GitHub moust4ki, 2026-10-26): Uniform swipes — in every list: Lu (with \"Annuler\", stays until refresh), Dernière page, Super favori, Retirer\n\n### Scope\n\n**Uniform swipes** in every list: Lu (with \"Annuler\", stays until refresh), Dernière page, Super favori, Retirer\n\n- Phase: 4 · Priority: high · Status: proposed · Owner: —\n\n### Depends on\n\nLOT-045 (#71), LOT-051 (#77), LOT-064 (#89)\n\nEngine dependencies as written: 045, 051, 064\n\n### Open questions\n\n\"Annuler\" needs the previous flag URL\n\n### Spec\n\n`docs/features/FEAT-008.md` does not exist yet; create it when moving idea → spec (ADR 0011 §2).\n\n### Source\n\n[docs/FEATURES.md](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/FEATURES.md), [research/bybifok-proposals.md](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/research/bybifok-proposals.md); proposal credit stays with Bybifok (CREDITS.md).\n",
